    "name": "Data Enrichment AI Intelligence Platform",
    "description": "# Data Enrichment AI Intelligence Platform API Collection\n\nProduction Postman collection for validating, testing, and demonstrating the 3-microservice **Data Enrichment AI Intelligence Platform**.\n\n## Microservices Architecture\n- **dataset-service** (`{{datasetBaseUrl}}` default `:9743`): Batch enrichment jobs, row-level tracking, MySQL entity persistence.\n- **research-service** (`{{researchBaseUrl}}` default `:9741`): Multi-source web discovery, crawling, scraping, evidence collection.\n- **ai-intelligent-service** (`{{aiBaseUrl}}` default `:9742`): Requirement interpretation, input cleansing, grounded fact extraction (Spring AI + Gemini).\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "datasetBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9743",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL for the Dataset Service"
    },
    {
      "key": "researchBaseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9741",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL for the Research Service"
